==Strategy==
This stage is similar in difficulty to an early ItF 2 stage, and as such, getting both of the ItF 1 crystals helps tremendously here with the aliens. Overall, this isn't a hard stage, as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] outranges Count Owlbrow, and as such, the standard meatshield spam strat works here.

